WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.025
Section 4.

00:00:01.975 --> 00:00:05.625
The CRCC — a watchdog without teeth.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:14.850
The Civilian Review and Complaints Commission can investigate complaints against the RCMP, but it cannot compel compliance with its recommendations.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:19.187
The RCMP routinely ignores CRCC findings.

00:00:19.187 --> 00:00:23.825
A watchdog that cannot enforce is not a watchdog — it is theatre.
